# Project summary protocol

The map of this repo is `.cursor/project/summary.md`.

## On every session

Read the summary before broad exploration. Use the quick-reference table to find modules.

## After structural changes

Update only the sections you affected. Bump `Last updated`. Do not rewrite the whole file.

Update when you add/rename/remove a module, Prisma model/enum, env var, npm script, integration, or a convention in `AGENTS.md`.
